# Icons

## Two roles — don’t mix

| Surface | Style | Use for |
|---------|--------|---------|
| Trees, nav, surface-registry icons | Product icon **registry** | Named chrome icons with token tint |
| Interactive controls | Stroke library (e.g. Lucide) | Chevrons, close, menus, checkboxes |

## Do

- Add new chrome icons only through the registry map
- Tint with theme tokens via a color prop
- Preserve semantic status colors when they carry meaning

## Don't

- Import raw SVG assets ad hoc in feature components
- Flatten meaningful status colors to muted without reason
- Branch on `isDark` for icon color when tokens exist

## Adapt for this repo

- Name the registry module and wrapper component
- Document which slug/name scheme the product uses

See `docs/build-foundation/03-visual-system.md`.
